    Overview v2.4 tile palette)
  ✓ TiQuickActionStyle: hover #6366F1 indigo → #2563EB blue-600
  ✓ TiQuickActionStyle: pressed #3730A3 → #1E3A8A blue-900
  ✓ TiSecondaryActionStyle: hover #6366F1 → #2563EB
  ✓ Card header icon backgrounds shifted to industrial blue palette:
      • KPI header:        #047857 green → #1E40AF sapphire
      • Recent Invoices:   #4338CA indigo → #1E3A8A deep blue
      • Invoice Aging:     #B91C1C KEPT (semantic red — overdue)
      • Top Customers:     #B45309 amber → #0369A1 teal-blue
      • Revenue Trend:     #4338CA indigo → #1D4ED8 royal blue
  ✓ Card header title Foreground matches new icon color
  ✓ PanningMode "None" → "VerticalOnly", Focusable "True" → "False"
